X-Dimension [Worker]
Type how many parts the Worker can carry in the X-Dimension into the text box.
Remarks
The carrying capacity of the Worker is X-Dimension times Y-Dimension times Z-Dimension. The greatest
allowed value is one million.
If you decrease the carrying capacity of the Worker, make sure that no parts are located on the places that
will be deleted by this action! Either delete these parts or move them to another place on the reduced
carrying capacity area.
