Service [text box]
Shows the name of the brokered or of the assigned service for the Worker who carries a part. If the Worker
is brokered to an importer, the text box shows the brokered service.
Remarks
If the Worker carries parts to a Destination, he is no longer brokered. While the Worker carries parts, the
assigned service is shown which corresponds to the brokered service during loading. The service remains
assigned until the Worker has unloaded all parts.
While he is loading, the Worker is brokered. For this reason you can query this service during the Loading
Time with the method getExportedServices.
