Tab Statistics
Tab Statistics [Worker]
Plant Simulation shows the most important statistical data on the tab Statistics.
Remarks
The tab Statistics shows the values for the Services and for the Worker. For each of these blocks, adding
up the individual values results in 100 percent.
The Worker collects failed times of the services and of the Worker. The Worker only collects Failed times
that accrue during the processing time, i.e., times that are located outside of the paused and of the
unplanned time.
Waiting times only accumulate during the times if the Worker is available, i.e., if these times are located
outside of the paused, the unplanned, and of the failed times.
